diff --git a/docs/templates.rst b/docs/templates.rst
index 89958b86..ce52ef07 100644
--- a/docs/templates.rst
+++ b/docs/templates.rst
@@ -1693,6 +1693,15 @@ To bind more than one expression, separate each with a comma (``,``).
 To pluralize, specify both the singular and plural forms separated by
 the ``pluralize`` tag.
 
+The optional ``priority`` expression requests fallback levels starting
+at 0. It is converted to an integer and limited to level 9. Invalid and
+negative values use only level 0. If no priority provider is installed,
+the ordinary translation callable is used once.
+
+.. code-block:: jinja
+
+    {% trans priority=user.translation_priority %}Welcome{% endtrans %}
+
 .. code-block:: jinja
 
     {% trans count=list|length %}
